or specific domains (e.g., legal, medical).",\n      "isEnabled": true\n    },\n    {\n      "name": "Speaker Diarization & Waveform Avatars",\n      "description": "Identifies and separates speakers, displaying visual waveform avatars for each.",\n      "isEnabled": true\n    },\n    {\n      "name": "On-device Processing",\n      "description": "Performs translation and processing locally for offline or privacy-sensitive environments.",\n      "isEnabled": true\n    },\n    {\n      "name": "Smart Glossary Builder",\n      "description": "Automatically builds a glossary of frequently used phrases for quick reference and tuning.",\n      "isEnabled": true\n    },\n    {\n      "name": "Regional Dialect & Mixed-language Support",\n      "description": "Handles regional dialects and conversations with mixed languages.",\n      "isEnabled": true\n    },\n    {\n      "name": "Export Options for Translated Videos",\n      "description": "Exports videos with hardcoded or soft subtitles in the translated language.",\n      "isEnabled": true\n    },\n    {\n      "name": "Accessibility Features",\n      "description": "Includes speech speed control and transcript download for accessibility.",\n      "isEnabled": true\n    }\n  ],\n  "techStack": {\n    "frontend": [\n      "React JS"\n    ],\n    "backend": [\n      "None"\n    ],\n    "language": [\n      "JavaScript (ES6+)"\n    ]\n  },\n  "colors": {\n    "primary": "#1A237E",\n    "secondary": "#00B8D4",\n    "accent": "#FFD600"\n  },\n  "theme": "light",\n  "layoutDescription": "The UI features a live video feed with overlaid, color-coded subtitles for each speaker. A sidebar provides controls for input mode (voice/text), domain selection, accent/tone options, glossary access, and export tools. Speaker avatars with waveform animations appear below the video. Accessibility controls (speech speed, transcript download) are easily accessible."\n}'}",
